  "ownsLevel": {
    "confidence": "verified",
    "items": [
      "`EncSabreCat` 023AB5: no record outside the table keeps its own level. The Snowy Sabre Cat `EncSabreCatSnow` 023AB6 uses it as its template but not for `Stats`, and the Guardian Spirit `dunHunterSabreCat` 0E7EAD does the same with 023AB6, so each keeps its own level when the one above it changes.",
      "The other rows: no other record keeps its own level.",
      "One more Vale Sabre Cat has no template and sets its own level 6: `DLC1EncSabreCatDEAD` 00F798:Dawnguard.esm (a corpse in `DLC1FalmerValleyPOI02` 000CC0:Dawnguard.esm; on no census page).",
      "Every other sabre cat record (`DunLostKnifeSabreCat`, `dunRavenscarSabreCat`, the spriggan-companion cats and every `Lvl*Predator` / `LvlSabreCatAll` / `LvlAnimalSnowFields` wrapper) carries `Stats` and follows its template or list."
    ]
